			"notes": "# ventils 1.0.0\n### Features:\n- **F7/M7 Roles:** marks your classes inactive terminals, devices, and levers during the Goldor phase, with an optional Term Info HUD to display\n- **Boss death titles:** titles for Maxor, Storm, Goldor, and Necron deaths, plus Maxor stunned, Storm crushed, and all players in the core\n- **Platform highlight:** highlights the 3x3 you must break to prevent the platform from breaking\n- **Early enter helper** tracks the first player into each early-enter spot (Mid, SS, EE2, EE3, Core) on a HUD display and shows a leap reminder when a Goldor section starts.\n- **Leap messages** sends a party chat line when you enter an early-enter zone, and can draw boxes around those zones."
		}
